  ],
  "en": [
   "London Underground 1973 Stock driving car"
  ]
 },
 "summary": {
  "ja": [
   "ロンドン地下鉄ピカデリー線の 1973 形電車の運転台のある車を、おもちゃの車台に載る大きさで起こした 3D モデル。丸い断面の車体に、赤い運転室の端と扉、白と青。寸法は写真から読んだ。"
  ],
  "en": [
   "3D model of the driving car of a London Underground 1973 Stock Piccadilly line train, sized to sit on a toy chassis. Round-profile body with a red cab end and doors, white and blue. Dimensions were read from photographs."
  ]
 },
